# The canonical production origin, with protocol and NO trailing slash.
#
# ⚠️ MUST be the host that returns HTTP 200 — for this site that is the WWW
# version. Verified 30 Jul 2026:
#     https://ujjainastro.com/      → 307 redirect → www
#     https://www.ujjainastro.com/  → 200 OK
#
# If this variable is missing in an environment, src/lib/siteConfig.ts falls
# back to the production URL below (it used to fall back to the vercel.app
# preview domain, which is how every canonical tag on the site ended up
# pointing at a domain you don't own the brand of).
#
# Set this in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables for
# Production. Leave it UNSET for Preview/Development so previews are obviously
# non-canonical — middleware.ts noindexes them regardless.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://www.ujjainastro.com
